WEBVTT

00:01:30.145 --> 00:01:32.094
We know that scientifically,

00:01:32.118 --> 00:01:34.064
thanks to the communications revolution,

00:01:34.088 --> 00:01:37.656
all the tribes on the planet --
all 15,000 tribes --

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.291
are in touch with each other.

00:01:40.283 --> 00:01:42.676
And it's a big family reunion.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.382
And yet, like many family reunions,

00:01:44.406 --> 00:01:46.629
it's not all peace and light.

00:01:46.653 --> 00:01:48.554
There's a lot of conflict,

00:01:48.578 --> 00:01:51.976
and the question is:
How do we deal with our differences?

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.096
How do we deal with
our deepest differences,

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.829
given the human propensity for conflict

00:01:56.853 --> 00:02:01.380
and the human genius at devising
weapons of enormous destruction?